ату и ошибки сопоставления\" owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.interaction receive=D22_sequence_suppliers.m12Receive send=D22_sequence_suppliers.m12Send sequence=12 sort=asynchSignal\nview view_a20fff0ae4d2 \"\" diagram=D22_sequence_suppliers element=D22_sequence_suppliers.m12\noccurrence D22_sequence_suppliers.m13Send \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane3 order=27 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.temporary\noccurrence D22_sequence_suppliers.m13Receive \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane2 order=28 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.temporary\nmessage D22_sequence_suppliers.m13 \"Тайм-аут / 429 / 5xx: отложенный повтор\" owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.interaction receive=D22_sequence_suppliers.m13Receive replyTo=D22_sequence_suppliers.m4 send=D22_sequence_suppliers.m13Send sequence=13 sort=reply\nview view_c168d4340bcb \"\" diagram=D22_sequence_suppliers element=D22_sequence_suppliers.m13\noccurrence D22_sequence_suppliers.m14Send \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane2 order=29 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.temporary\noccurrence D22_sequence_suppliers.m14Receive \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane1 order=30 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.temporary\nmessage D22_sequence_suppliers.m14 \"Старые данные сохранены с прежней датой\" owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.interaction receive=D22_sequence_suppliers.m14Receive send=D22_sequence_suppliers.m14Send sequence=14 sort=asynchSignal\nview view_7c0dd2e724dc \"\" diagram=D22_sequence_suppliers element=D22_sequence_suppliers.m14\noccurrence D22_sequence_suppliers.m15Send \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane2 order=31 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.temporary\noccurrence D22_sequence_suppliers.m15Receive \"\" lifeline=D22_sequence_suppliers.lane5 order=32 owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.temporary\nmessage D22_sequence_suppliers.m15 \"Записать retry_count, next_attempt_at и причину; после 3 повторов завершить с ошибкой\" owner=D22_sequence_suppliers.interaction receive=D22_sequence_suppliers.m15Receive send=D22_sequence_suppliers.m1